<title>USA: St Elizabeth's Hospital, Ill., bonds repriced.</title>
<headline>St Elizabeth's Hospital, Ill., bonds repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ziegler Securities said Tuesday it repriced $12 million Illinois Health Facilities Authority bonds. The top yield was approximately 6.495 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>ILLINOIS HEALTH FACILITIES AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $12,000,000</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1996</p>
<p>(ST. ELIZABETH'S HOSPITAL OF CHICAGO, INC.)</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE FORMAL AWARD IS EXPECTED TOMORROW.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: NR		    S&amp;P: BBB</p>
<p>    DATED: 10/15/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 07/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT     COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>07/01/2005		1,425M    6.00  %	100.00</p>
<p>07/01/2010		1,450M    6.25  %	 99.375</p>
<p>						    (Approx. Yield 6.318)</p>
<p>07/01/2016		2,430M    6.25  %	 98.375</p>
<p>						    (Approx. Yield 6.396)</p>
<p>07/01/2026		6,695M    6.375 %	 98.421</p>
<p>						    (Approx. Yield 6.495)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 07/01/2006    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 07/01/2008</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, October 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on November 21, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
<p>Ziegler Securities</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
